canonical_printed_types.SM.separated_contact_interior_or_exterio:
SM.separated_contact_interior_or_exterior {n : ℕ} [NeZero n] (hn : 3 ≤ n) {P : SM.LabelledTuple n} {M a : ZMod n}
  (hsep : SM.ContactSeparated M a) (hz : SM.pointZeroTriples P = {SM.contactSupport M a}) :
  P M ∈ SM.edgeInterior P a ∨ P M ∉ SM.edgeSegment P a

